OL,5,G1800 Home and Away
OL,6,     FRemi gives Sonny an ultimatum.
OL,7,     FBeau's temper reaches breaking
OL,8,     Fpoint. Alf has reservations about
OL,9,     FMarilyn's new friend. David and
OL,10,     FAmelia clear the air.
OL,11,G1830 Home and Away
OL,12,     FRemi gives Sonny an ultimatum.
OL,13,     FBeau pleads his case. David
OL,14,     Fexecutes a search warrant.
OL,15,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,16,     FIn Birmingham, a valued staff
OL,17,     Fmember is leaving after 42 years
OL,18,     Fin the NHS. Meanwhile, patients in
OL,19,     Fneed of care include a man worried
OL,20,     Fabout persistent bleeding from his
OL,21,     Fback passage.
