OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FAfter a quiet start to the day,
OL,7,     Fthe staff at Barnsley casualty
OL,8,     Ftreat John who has hit is head
OL,9,     Ffalling at home and seven month
OL,10,     Fold Elisa is treated in
OL,11,     Fpaediatrics.
OL,12,G2100 999: Critical Condition
OL,13,     FThe work of a major hospital
OL,14,     Ftrauma unit. Ian is rushed in
OL,15,     Fafter suffering a cardiac arrest.
OL,16,     FKen is flown to the hospital by
OL,17,     Fhelicopter after falling from a
OL,18,     Froof onto a skip.
