OL,5,G2200 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FA 69-year-old fisherman is brought
OL,7,     Finto resus helicopter after an
OL,8,     Faccident out at sea; a man is
OL,9,     Fbleeding in his brain after being
OL,10,     Fhit with a lorry.
OL,11,G2300 Trauma Room One
OL,12,     FJames, 63, is losing feeling and
OL,13,     Ffunction in his hands and fingers.
OL,14,     FSurgeons must act fast to remove
OL,15,     Fdisc and bone from his neck. Will
OL,16,     Fthey save James from an uncertain
OL,17,     Ffuture? (Ep8)
